    "status" : "extensions",
    "div" : "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: ValueSet ng-hiv-kp-typology-vs</b></p><a name=\"ng-hiv-kp-typology-vs\"> </a><a name=\"hcng-hiv-kp-typology-vs\"> </a><ul><li>Include these codes as defined in <a href=\"CodeSystem-ng-hiv-care-art-codes-cs.html\"><code>https://fhir-ig.digitalhealth.gov.ng/CodeSystem/ng-hiv-care-art-codes-cs</code></a><span title=\"Version is not explicitly stated, which means it is fixed to the version provided in this specification\"> version &#x1F4E6;0.0.0</span><table class=\"none\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td><td><b>Definition</b></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-ng-hiv-care-art-codes-cs.html#ng-hiv-care-art-codes-cs-kp-typology-1\">kp-typology-1</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">MSM</td><td>Source form code 1: Men who have sex with men.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-ng-hiv-care-art-codes-cs.html#ng-hiv-care-art-codes-cs-kp-typology-2\">kp-typology-2</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">FSW</td><td>Source form code 2: Female sex workers.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-ng-hiv-care-art-codes-cs.html#ng-hiv-care-art-codes-cs-kp-typology-3\">kp-typology-3</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">PWID</td><td>Source form code 3: People who inject drugs.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-ng-hiv-care-art-codes-cs.html#ng-hiv-care-art-codes-cs-kp-typology-4\">kp-typology-4</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">TG</td><td>Source form code 4: Transgender persons.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-ng-hiv-care-art-codes-cs.html#ng-hiv-care-art-codes-cs-kp-typology-5\">kp-typology-5</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Persons in custodial centers</td><td>Source form code 5.</td></tr></table></li></ul></div>"
